The cells is a list of 9, 9, 4, 6, 6, 8, 2, 1, and 1.
The order is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 8.
Place spot into order.

For every left from 0 to 8.
For every right from left to 8.
The lcell is item left of order.
The rcell is item right of order.
If item rcell of cells is less than item lcell of cells, swap item left of order and item right of order.

The depth is a list of 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, and 1.
For every rank from 0 to 8.
The spot is 8 minus rank.
The cell is item spot of order.
The row is cell divided by 3.
The column is cell modulo 3.
The here is item cell of cells.
The best is 1.
The up is 0.
The down is 0.
The west is 0.
The east is 0.
If row is more than 0, set up to item (cell minus 3) of depth.
If row is less than 2, set down to item (cell plus 3) of depth.
If column is more than 0, set west to item (cell minus 1) of depth.
If column is less than 2, set east to item (cell plus 1) of depth.
If row is more than 0 and item (cell minus 3) of cells is more than here and up plus 1 is more than best, set best to up plus 1.
If row is less than 2 and item (cell plus 3) of cells is more than here and down plus 1 is more than best, set best to down plus 1.
If column is more than 0 and item (cell minus 1) of cells is more than here and west plus 1 is more than best, set best to west plus 1.
If column is less than 2 and item (cell plus 1) of cells is more than here and east plus 1 is more than best, set best to east plus 1.
Set item cell of depth to best.

The answer is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 8.
If item spot of depth is more than answer, set answer to item spot of depth.

Show answer.
